<title>PHILIPPINES: Centennial 1st half net at 17.85 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Centennial 1st half net at 17.85 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial City Inc said on Monday its after-tax profit in the first half ended December 31, 1996 reached 17.85 million pesos.</p>
<p>It did not give comparative figures for last year.</p>
<p>Centennial City was formerly Guoco Land Philippines Inc.</p>
</text>
